CHAPTER.VERS:
Then the Levites, Jeshua, and Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah, [and] Pethahiah, said, Stand up and bless Yahweh your

          {+}
         God from everlasting to everlasting; and let them bless your glorious name, which is exalted above all blessing and praise.
